<task id="064" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Author 5 new ArchTests for §4D I1-I5 tenant-isolation invariants</title>
    <phase>C Wave C6 — Tenant-Isolation ArchTests + Audit Sweep</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'testing','integration-test'; TEST-MODIFYING override — unconditional FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8 override row. Enforces 5 binding tenant-isolation invariants; blast-radius = entire BFF (a wrong assertion breaks every PR).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Requires reasoning through EVERY BFF service call site touching AI Search / Cosmos / Graph / SPE to author ArchTest predicates that fail on violation without false positives. Step 3.5.5b sonnet @ xhigh justified per complex-brownfield criteria (per project CLAUDE.md model-tier defaults).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>042</deps>
    <tags>testing, integration-test, l2-controlplane, auth</tags>
